The '''Rat Pet''' is a {{Skl|Combat}} [[Morphs|Morph]] that was added after [[The Uprising]] as a perk of {{RN|Minister|56ms}}: "Infestation". It was the first [[Morphs|Morph]] ever created in the game. 

== Obtaining ==
The '''Rat Pet''' can be obtained by killing {{MobSprite|Rat (Hub);Rat (Hub)}} found in the [[Hub Island|Hub]] or by killing {{MobSprite|Rat (Pest);Rat Pests}} found in [[The Garden]].
