== Usage ==
The '''Rat Pet''' grants its owner the ability to disguise themselves as a Rat while being able to control its movements. This ability functions similarly to the [[Rock Pet|Rock Pet's]] "Rideable" ability.

The '''Rat Pet''' is controlled by facing the direction the player wants to move and selecting a hotbar slot (1 being the fastest and 9, the slot with the [[SkyBlock Menu]], being the slowest, causing the player to remain stationary. Slot 8 is the hotbar slot with the slowest speed where the player is still moving.)

When riding the '''Rat Pet''', a message will sometimes appear notifying the player that there is {{Item|Tasty Cheese}} nearby. When collecting nearby cheese, the '''Rat Pet''' will grant a random player {{stat|mf}}. The amount of {{stat|mf}} and time the buff is granted depends on the level of the '''Rat Pet'''. While a player is given this boost, the owner of the pet has a {{Green|20%}} chance to receive most drops the buffed player gets. This does not apply to [[Slayer|slayer bosses]] and {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}. It also does not grant progress towards [[Collections]].

When collecting {{Item|Tasty Cheese}}, the player cannot buff another player who already has a {{AN|Rat's Blessing}} active. If there is no player without a buff active in the lobby, then no one will receive the buff.

