== Trivia ==
*This pet was added as part of {{RN|yt|56ms}}'s mayor perk, due to his position as a [[Resistance General]].
*Entering the portal in the Hub while riding the '''Rat Pet''' won't teleport the player.
*The '''Rat Pet''', unlike the {{Item|Horse Pet}} and {{Item|Skeleton Horse Pet}}, will push the player through non-solid blocks (slabs, fences, etc.). This will cause the player to suffocate.
**Like the {{Item|Horse Pet}} and {{Item|Skeleton Horse Pet}}, the player can still glitch through walls as long as they are one block thick.
*If the player is the only person in the lobby when collecting a {{Item|Tasty Cheese}}, then no one will receive the buff.
*The Rat Pet is currently the only [[Morphs|Morph]].
*The {{AN|CHEESE!}} ability (and consequently the {{AN|Rat's Blessing}} ability) will not activate on a Player's {{zone|Private Island}} or {{zone|The Garden}}, making player unable to build farms that allow them to AFK and get loads of cheese efficiently.
*While riding the '''Rat Pet''', the player is immune to fall damage.
*When the {{Item|Great Spook Staff}}'s {{AN|Spook}} ability is used while riding the '''Rat Pet''', they are visibly riding the rat after the ability runs out.
* If a player is morphed into a '''Rat Pet''' and moves near a player with a {{Item|Crow Pet}} equipped, the '''Rat Pet''' is despawned and the following message is sent in chat: <ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/HypixelSkyblock/comments/1s5p1ox/crows_apparently_eat_rats/</ref>
{{Dialogue|&e&lOOPS! &7Your Crow ate <player>'s Rat!}}

